OL,3,GNEWSAThe gymnast so successful she lost
OL,4,Acount of her medals
OL,5,
OL,6,FEllie-Bea Thomas was just nine when she
OL,7,Ftook on her first gymnastics
OL,8,Fcompetition and years later she has
OL,9,Fgone on to represent Great Britain
OL,10,Fhundreds of times.
OL,12,FThe 27-year-old, from Milton Malsor,
OL,13,Fnear Northampton, who has Down's
OL,14,Fsyndrome, said rhythmic gymnastics came
OL,15,Fnaturally to her as a child while it
OL,16,Fhad helped with her coordination and
OL,17,Fconfidence.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
