OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAThe gymnast so successful she lost
OL,4,Acount of her medals
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring her sporting career she has
OL,7,Ftaken hundreds of gold medals home - to
OL,8,Fthe point where she has lost track of
OL,9,Fthem all - and this week competes in
OL,10,Fthe National Summer Games in
OL,11,FBirmingham.
OL,13,FAiming for another gold, she said she
OL,14,Fcould not wait to get going, while her
OL,15,Fmother and coach, Anne Thomas, 67, said
OL,16,Fshe was "proud" of her daughter.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
